Package: craft-anything
Version: 0.5.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: glibc, curl, tar
Section: security
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/storytold/craft-anything
Description: Reverse-engineering engine and AI-assisted rebuild CLI
 Craft Anything is a pure-Rust reverse-engineering engine with tools for
 websites, native apps, games, and more. It can inspect a target and use a
 coding agent to rebuild it. This package installs the prebuilt
 craft-anything-cli command and MCP server using Termux's glibc environment.
 The native desktop GUI is not included.
